WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.794 --> 00:00:08.963
That night at home, Javier went back to the Best American Talent website. He wanted to learn

2
00:00:08.964 --> 00:00:18.521
more about the audition process. Stretched out on his bed, he watched a video called "All You

3
00:00:18.522 --> 00:00:26.847
Need to Know." It featured Alana Hendricks, one of the TV show's hosts. "Contestants don't need to submit

