the form when he spotted a notice: "At least one contact person must be 18 years of

12
00:01:28.722 --> 00:01:38.565
age or older. School groups must be registered by a teacher or coach." "Ugh." Javier sighed. Everyone

13
00:01:38.566 --> 00:01:42.729
