00:02:46.662 --> 00:02:50.824
You have to think positively here, Will. This is an opportunity." "I don't know, Javier. What about—"

24
00:02:50.825 --> 00:02:55.655
"Hey, guys!" Marty came running over. "Look, I hate to tell you this, but I'm quitting your

25
