00:03:08.560 --> 00:03:11.725
anymore. You know how Malcolm was going to Octagonal's practice at the high school?" Marty spoke in

27
00:03:11.726 --> 00:03:16.136
a rush, as if he wanted to get this over with. "Well, it turns out a couple of

28
00:03:16.137 --> 00:03:21.310
guys had quit, so they asked him to join, and they still needed another guy, and he

