34
00:03:49.523 --> 00:03:53.946
five. You'll see. We'll be fine." Will raised a skeptical eyebrow. *** After school Javier met Will

35
00:03:53.947 --> 00:04:00.190
in the gym. Ian wasn't there yet, and neither was Mr. D. Unlike the day before, Will

36
00:04:00.191 --> 00:04:04.690
was not plugging his phone into a speaker. "What's the point?" he muttered to Javier. "We're the

