38
00:04:13.834 --> 00:04:17.409
Ian came running into the gym but didn't bother to remove his backpack or his jacket. "Where were

39
00:04:17.410 --> 00:04:20.683
you yesterday?" Javier asked. "My mom made me text her a photo of my latest math test.

40
00:04:20.684 --> 00:04:28.992
When she saw the big, red 46 percent on top, she made me come home right away.

41
00:04:28.993 --> 00:04:35.913
Then she took away my phone and said—" "Did you hear that Malcolm and Marty quit?" Will

