52
00:05:40.439 --> 00:05:47.020
the girls' basketball coach, stopped me. The team's new season starts soon. She was complaining about the

53
00:05:47.021 --> 00:05:53.011
low attendance at games—apparently very few people come to watch." "Well, most games are right after school,

54
00:05:53.012 --> 00:05:58.414
and people do have other activities," Will said. Javier heard the faint sound of a coach's whistle

55
