00:06:17.902 --> 00:06:25.710
I couldn't help her right now, because I needed to be in the gym for you guys.

59
00:06:25.711 --> 00:06:31.566
And suddenly her eyes lit up. The next thing I knew, she was asking if you'd consider

60
00:06:31.567 --> 00:06:38.971
performing during halftime. I said sure! This will give you some great experience before the TV show

61
00:06:38.972 --> 00:06:43.872
